; NAVAPP application family. The firmware region registry holding the real NAVAPP
; apps is encrypted (ni2k_*/NAVAPP.ERG), so these compatibility entries provide the
; startup keys PROCNAV checks: every FC component init gate (`s32InitApp*`, see
; docs/reverse_engineering) resolves its AppID through the SCD lookup ioctl and then
; opens this key and queries APPID; only then is the component started. The AppIDs
; are the constants compiled into those gates (FC_NAVI=1, FC_TEA=19, FC_STAT=22,
; WDB=23, FC_LBS=284; 3 belongs to the small `s32InitApp03` component).
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\BLAUPUNKT\PROCESS\NAVAPP]
